 *
 * During BST (UTC+1): localToUtc('2026-06-03', 9, 15) = 2026-06-03T08:15:00.000Z
 * During GMT (UTC+0): localToUtc('2026-01-15', 9, 15) = 2026-01-15T09:15:00.000Z
